\caption{ (a) PD and cumulative PD of gaps in photons below 1.21 GeV. (b) The modeling with and without the gap bin with PL function. (c) The allowed maximum observed GeV photons of different $\Delta t_{\rm in}$ for each time bins.\label{fig:maxEobsGeV_dTin}}
